---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer
  class="mt-20 mb-5 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 text-gray-500 flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse justify-start sm:justify-between"
>
    <p class="text-sm">
      {currentYear} - Toma las ideas que necesites, y si te sobran algunas, <a
        href="https://github.com/adrianpisabarrogarcia/adrianpisabarro.com"
        class="hover:underline"
        aria-label="Si te sobran algunas ideas, déjalas aquí"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank">déjalas aquí</a
      > 😉
    </p>
    <a
      href="/#contacto"
      class="hover:underline flex items-center mb-2 sm:mb-0"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="20"
        height="20"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-mail me-1"
        ><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
          d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-14a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-10z"
        ></path><path d="M3 7l9 6l9 -6"></path></svg
      >
      Cuéntame tu proyecto
    </a>
</footer>
